  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It'd be nice to have the WMR controller sticks be used for movement and the touchpads used only for gestures. Right now the sticks aren't used at all. Also it'd be nice to have smooth movement with the sticks, and to have the direction you're looking be where you go when moving forward.",
